# Voice text

- `Voice:` line hamesha Devanagari Hindi mein likho. Yahi text awaaz banega. Delivery, pause, loud, tez jaise shabd is line mein mat likho.
- `Delivery:` alag likho. Yeh awaaz mein nahi jaata. Format: `tez|normal|dheema, josh 1-5, zor "शब्द", ruk <sec>` (optional `sur upar|neeche`). `tools/voice_clone.py` yahi padhta hai. Detail `prompts/voice-delivery.md`.
- `Action:` alag likho: camera par body language, josh ke hisaab se (josh 5 = jhukna/point, josh 2 = muskaan/nod).
- Josh poori video mein upar-neeche ho: hook 5, beech 3-4, CTA 2.
- Reaction filler mat likho: Aree, Achaa, Dekho, Suno, Matlab, Bas. Na voice mein, na caption mein, na overlay mein.
- Overlay, title, caption Roman Hinglish.
- Tech words voice mein Devanagari: गिट, गिटहब, कमिट, पुश. Roman spelling voice line mein mat chhodo.
- Vowel mat kheench. Ek line ek saans.
- Hook ek chhota vaakya, tez, pehla keyword zor se. Beech normal, fact ke baad ruk. Aakhri line dheemi aur saaf.
